    {
      "id": "u_58143dbe630bf0551f763f3a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The connections tab groups together all the information about the current note and how it relates to other notes, in four different sections.",
      "sourceHash": "58143dbe630bf0551f763f3a331abf64a3329eeb556287bfb8ce5b60a326c921",
      "context": "Connections tab",
      "contextHash": "60a420e75a960125c9d659a91c28eb5a6bf4ad56f45a49d46d3c5a3741fb553b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7efd6d9f8fcb20ec0a5a4012_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "It's generally best to keep only the desired sections expanded as each of the sections have to retrieve additional data that might not otherwise be needed. While collapsed, the sections do not retrieve any additional data.",
      "sourceHash": "7efd6d9f8fcb20ec0a5a4012747f5a2c61befd1f2c8aa34fa609b9c49f01abeb",
      "context": "Connections tab",
      "contextHash": "60a420e75a960125c9d659a91c28eb5a6bf4ad56f45a49d46d3c5a3741fb553b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e8e2ed79ec674afe8d811a39_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Note map__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "e8e2ed79ec674afe8d811a3977d71b8eb7a65d3f2dda33935072c19de2fff672",
      "context": "Connections tab > Note map",
      "contextHash": "817b3c2a34dd034441051312d142fa0f0f8cbfb1b62e39b6010942a17cd05a45",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a0974da98e24e31a4cfe05b8_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The note map displays a graph which shows the relation between the current notes and other notes on the hierarchy. There are two types of visualizations, which can be selected from the top-right part of the section:",
      "sourceHash": "a0974da98e24e31a4cfe05b87bd3dfaf147bc473ee5ddb2e14e36c5839c4c954",
      "context": "Connections tab > Note map",
      "contextHash": "817b3c2a34dd034441051312d142fa0f0f8cbfb1b62e39b6010942a17cd05a45",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0731a155812c4fc8ad9b9ac5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__Link map__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (__TRILIUM_PH_2__), which displays the __TRILIUM_PH_3__relations__TRILIUM_PH_4__ between notes.",
      "sourceHash": "0731a155812c4fc8ad9b9ac53bfc86605eb20ada885262110a7986debd4baee5",
      "context": "Connections tab > Note map",
      "contextHash": "817b3c2a34dd034441051312d142fa0f0f8cbfb1b62e39b6010942a17cd05a45",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_71c9e5fbce71bc714cc10d46_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__Tree map__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (__TRILIUM_PH_2__), which displays the hierarchical structure.",
      "sourceHash": "71c9e5fbce71bc714cc10d46c8325eaadd64fffb8851990233695b36010de1f4",
      "context": "Connections tab > Note map",
      "contextHash": "817b3c2a34dd034441051312d142fa0f0f8cbfb1b62e39b6010942a17cd05a45",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_048426cd64b9452c2f1a8b7b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The sidebar will remember which visualization is selected, as a global option. Note that note maps also have a __TRILIUM_PH_0__ which describes which visualization to use, but the sidebar deliberately ignores that to keep consistency when switching between notes.",
      "sourceHash": "048426cd64b9452c2f1a8b7b0130887f3592859bc9798992e97dfefaebd0ecce",
      "context": "Connections tab > Note map",
      "contextHash": "817b3c2a34dd034441051312d142fa0f0f8cbfb1b62e39b6010942a17cd05a45",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3ff3334d9126f719e14e8773_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The map can also be expanded by pressing the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button in the top-right of the section. When expanded, the map is displayed in a separate dialog. Alternatively, all other sections can be collapsed, which will make the note map taller and the sidebar can be dragged to make for more lateral space.",
      "sourceHash": "3ff3334d9126f719e14e8773b929fd68fc9b6166cc9491497f5077bd73991cda",
      "context": "Connections tab > Note map",
      "contextHash": "817b3c2a34dd034441051312d142fa0f0f8cbfb1b62e39b6010942a17cd05a45",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e415ac16f67f1181ce88ee98_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The note map view inside the sidebar is deliberately more compact in order to fit the space: the link map would also show notes that don't have a link to the current note from the hierarchy (creating a cloud of dots) but this is only shown while the map is expanded. Similarly, the link strength and pin configuration buttons are not displayed here.",
      "sourceHash": "e415ac16f67f1181ce88ee98e3b22a57196243b715159a2a6e5b60332e16a052",
      "context": "Connections tab > Note map",
      "contextHash": "817b3c2a34dd034441051312d142fa0f0f8cbfb1b62e39b6010942a17cd05a45",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c1df43b71dbdddf8644d0a71_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "See also:",
