    {
      "id": "u_a0eadcc43be574d72ebfa236_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The note paths section displays the locations in which the current note is __TRILIUM_PH_0__cloned__TRILIUM_PH_1__. Each segment of the note path is clickable, in order to navigate to that note or clone. The root note is shown as its icon, the same as in the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Breadcrumb__TRILIUM_PH_3__; hovering it shows its title.",
      "sourceHash": "a0eadcc43be574d72ebfa2364009c9fcc15afacf8d4cdbdf8e716a6aedd92bed",
      "context": "Connections tab > Note paths",
      "contextHash": "43966ba29469472738ae00fdb9469ee6fc1ae36e61a92defc77a46a0d8725ec7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_80fe40b1e76b5b66893076f8_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A new clone can be created from the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button at the top-right.",
      "sourceHash": "80fe40b1e76b5b66893076f898e7d7ada6c855e2a9ed188e4452598c075e9ca1",
      "context": "Connections tab > Note paths",
      "contextHash": "43966ba29469472738ae00fdb9469ee6fc1ae36e61a92defc77a46a0d8725ec7",
      "status": "pending",
